                                "sense_id": "310b8d25-234b-33e6-882d-8f81fb40767d",
                                "text": "But we do see imperfect things in nature, dwarfed, blasted trees and other apparent miscarryings. Yet they are as perfect as their environment allows them to be."
                            }
                        ]
